        "action": "Ban shock and prong collars for dogs",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Ban the use of shock and prong collars for all dogs, including working dogs. We are concerned that scientific papers and welfare reports show that electronic shock collars cause physical pain, elevated stress and long-term psychological harm to dogs.",
